[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1033775972","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1407#issuecomment-1033775972","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1407","id":1033775972,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE849nitk","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-02-09T13:44:04Z","updated_at":"2022-02-09T13:44:04Z","body":"# New submission review\r\n\r\n## Has the license been approved by the OSI?\r\n*All OSI-approved license will be included on the SPDX License List, regardless of other factors*\r\n\r\nNo (not to my knowledge)\r\n\r\n## Definitive factors\r\n*These must all be satisfied to allow inclusion in the license list*\r\n\r\n### Is the submitted license unique, that is, it does not match another license already on the License List as per the matching guidelines?\r\n\r\nYes\r\n\r\n### If a software license, does it apply to source code and not only to executables?\r\n\r\nN/A, not a software license\r\n\r\n### Does the license have identifiable and stable text, and is not in the midst of drafting?\r\n\r\nYes, historical license which doesn't appear to be in midst of drafting\r\n\r\n### Has the license steward, if any, committed to versioning new versions in the future and to not modify it after addition to the list?\r\n\r\nTo the extent that there is a \"license steward\" for this one, it might be the author of the M+ Fonts -- see [wikipedia page](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/M%2B_FONTS). If so, note that it appears that they have moved to using [OFL-1.1 instead](https://mplusfonts.github.io/#license) for the M+ Fonts themselves, so probably unlikely to be modifying this further.\r\n\r\n## Other factors for inclusion\r\n*Roughly in order of descending importance*\r\n\r\n### 1. Does the license substantially comply with one of the free/open content definitions?\r\n*Approval by the organisation that publishes the definition is not required*\r\n\r\nYes - this is a short, informal license specific to fonts that appears to permit full use / reproduction / distribution, with modifications and for any purpose.\r\n\r\n### 2. Does the license have substantial use such that it is likely to be encountered (ie. use in many projects, or in one significant project)?\r\n*For recently written licenses, definitive plans for it to be used in at least one significant project satisfies this*\r\n\r\nAppears to be used for several fonts beyond M+, including those distributed as part of Fedora\r\n\r\n### 3. Is the license structured to be generally usable by anyone, and not specific to one organisation or project?\r\n\r\nYes\r\n\r\n### 4. Is the license primarily intended to facilitate the free distribution of content with limited restrictions?\r\n\r\nYes\r\n\r\n### 5. Does the license steward support this submission, or is at least aware of and not in opposition of it?\r\n\r\nProbably not aware, see above re: license author\r\n\r\n## Summary of factors / outcome\r\n*Comments on the totality of these \"other factors\" in light of the SPDX License List's overall goals and objectives*\r\n\r\n+1 to add, this appears to be a clearly \"free content\" license for fonts and has sufficient use as a historical license to warrant inclusion.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1033775972/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1050082177","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1407#issuecomment-1050082177","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1407","id":1050082177,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE84-lvuB","user":{"login":"capfei","id":5489711,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODk3MTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5489711?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/capfei","html_url":"https://github.com/capfei","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capfei/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capfei/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capfei/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capfei/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capfei/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capfei/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capfei/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capfei/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capfei/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-02-24T17:22:12Z","updated_at":"2022-02-24T17:22:12Z","body":"+1 to add","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1050082177/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart"